@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@userId = 507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

### Upload a user avatar (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/avatar HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SixCitiesBoundary

--SixCitiesBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar-max.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../markup/img/avatar-max.jpg
--SixCitiesBoundary--
